{
  "notes": [
    "Structural admission cases. A 128-hex signature is a shape check.",
    "The Rust crate verifies the SEA signature over s3rch-wrap-receipt-v1.",
    "atGate does not drop plaintext. One receipt does not clear another reader.",
    "A public-plain item is not rewritten. Whether that path stays is open."
